            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 980,
                "end_index": 1084,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "People are naturally polite and do not want to crush your dreams, so they give you **\"false positives\"**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 980,
                "end_index": 1169,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "People are naturally polite and do not want to crush your dreams, so they give you **\"false positives\"**\u2014meaning they nod, tell you it's a great idea, and say they \"would totally use it.\""
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 980,
                "end_index": 1226,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "People are naturally polite and do not want to crush your dreams, so they give you **\"false positives\"**\u2014meaning they nod, tell you it's a great idea, and say they \"would totally use it.\" But when you actually launch the product, no one buys it"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1229,
                "end_index": 1340,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**The Mom Test** is a set of rules for asking questions in such a way that **even your mom can\u2019t lie to you**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1515,
                "end_index": 1517,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1515,
                "end_index": 1559,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "** \n   Don\u2019t mention what you are building"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1561,
                "end_index": 1658,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "If you start by saying, *\"I have an idea for...\"* you immediately trigger their politeness filter"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1660,
                "end_index": 1749,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Instead, focus entirely on *their* world, their workflows, and their current frustrations"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1831,
                "end_index": 1833,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1831,
                "end_index": 1955,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**\n   People are terrible at predicting their future behavior, but they cannot easily lie about what they have actually done"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2056,
                "end_index": 2074,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "What did you do?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2106,
                "end_index": 2108,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2106,
                "end_index": 2155,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**\n   The more you talk, the more you are selling"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2157,
                "end_index": 2206,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Your goal is to be a detective, not a salesperson"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2208,
                "end_index": 2242,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Let them talk about their problems"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2273,
                "end_index": 2377,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Bad Questions\nThe core of the book is learning how to reframe questions to extract actual, unbiased data"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2465,
                "end_index": 2529,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| *\"Do you think this is a good idea?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2465,
                "end_index": 2573,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| *\"Do you think this is a good idea?\"* | *\"How do you currently solve [Problem]?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2465,
                "end_index": 2598,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| *\"Do you think this is a good idea?\"* | *\"How do you currently solve [Problem]?\"* | Opinions are worthless"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2600,
                "end_index": 2672,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "You need to see if they are already actively trying to solve the problem"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2674,
                "end_index": 2717,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"Would you buy a product that did X?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2674,
                "end_index": 2776,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"Would you buy a product that did X?\"* | *\"What did you do the last time this problem happened?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2674,
                "end_index": 2801,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"Would you buy a product that did X?\"* | *\"What did you do the last time this problem happened?\"* | Hypotheticals are lies"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2803,
                "end_index": 2878,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Past behavior is the only reliable indicator of future purchasing decisions"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2880,
                "end_index": 2917,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"How much would you pay for X?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2880,
                "end_index": 3050,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"How much would you pay for X?\"* | *\"How much does this problem currently cost you (in time or money)?\"* | People make up arbitrary numbers when asked hypothetically"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3124,
                "end_index": 3168,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"Would you ever use an app like this?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3124,
                "end_index": 3298,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "|\n| *\"Would you ever use an app like this?\"* | *\"Can you walk me through how you did [Task] yesterday?\"* | \"Would you ever\" invites future-tense promises that are rarely kept"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3300,
                "end_index": 3346,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Real-world workflows reveal actual pain points"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3535,
                "end_index": 3671,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Compliments:** If someone says, *\"That\u2019s so cool!\"* or *\"You're going to do great with this,\"* they are trying to get you to leave"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3673,
                "end_index": 3696,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Compliments are useless"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3698,
                "end_index": 3787,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Politely say \"thank you\" and redirect the conversation back to facts about their behavior"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3789,
                "end_index": 3925,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Feature Requests:** If a customer says, *\"I'd use this if it had a calendar integration,\"* do not write it down as a feature request"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3971,
                "end_index": 4018,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "How are you handling your schedule right now?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3971,
                "end_index": 4050,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "How are you handling your schedule right now?\"* Dig to find the root motivation"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4052,
                "end_index": 4163,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Fluff / Generics:** If they use words like *\"I usually...\"* or *\"I always...\"*, anchor them back to reality"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4209,
                "end_index": 4262,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Can you walk me through specifically what happened?\"*"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4264,
                "end_index": 4406,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### The Ultimate Test: Commitment\nAt the end of a good customer conversation, Fitzpatrick argues you must push for some form of **commitment**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4408,
                "end_index": 4491,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "If they say they love your idea but refuse to give you a commitment, they are lying"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4495,
                "end_index": 4529,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Commitment doesn't just mean money"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            }
